# Permanent Ayutam Android release signing certificate (SHA-256).
#
# This is a public certificate identity, not a secret. CI compares
# `apksigner verify --print-certs` from built APKs against this value so a
# rotated or wrong keystore in GitHub Secrets cannot silently ship.
#
# Confirmed 2026-08-26: local `android/ayutam-release.jks` matches all three
# GitHub Release v0.4.0 split APKs.
#
# Colon-separated uppercase hex. Changing this value is a sideload-breaking
# certificate rotation (users must uninstall).
19:7C:E3:83:A6:38:79:E9:8C:D1:C7:2F:DA:5E:83:EF:CF:39:FE:EC:A0:4D:17:76:2F:73:13:AD:B8:F9:22:49
